description:
Received City of Portland Response to BOE Motion
for Issuance of Protective Order, including City’s Response to February 10,
2005.

Received Notice of Motion and Motion to Dismiss Complaint Before
the Federal Maritime Commission; Memorandum of Points and Authorities;
Declaration of Peter F. Morgan.

Received Summary of Oral Presentation
from   Commissioner Rebecca F. Dye  (David Spence, Warren Dean, Henry Wiseman,
Steve DiNisco, Joseph Koslowski & Penelope Register).

Notice of Proposed Rulemaking; Extension of Time;
Submission of Oral Comments; Public Hearing appeared in the  Federal Register 68;
FR 17003. (Comments due: May 30, 2003).

Served (Motion to Admit Respondent's Surrebuttal Evidence Granted;
(2) Ruling on BOE's Motion to Admit Response to Respondent's Surrebuttal Evidence Deferred
Pending Respondent's Reply to Motion.

Notice of Filing of Complaint and Assignment
appeared in  Federal Register 59 FR 63996. Initial Decision due December 5, 1995;
final decision due April 5, 1996.
